flowchart LR
    Dev[git push origin main]
    GH[GitHub Actions runner]
    OIDC[OIDC token]
    Entra[Microsoft Entra ID<br/>federated credential]
    AT[Short-lived token]
    AZ[az login --federated-token]
    Bicep[Bicep what-if + deploy]
    ARM[Azure Resource Manager]
    RG[rg-iac-lab-eastus-01]

    Dev --> GH
    GH -.exchange.-> OIDC
    OIDC -.subject:<br/>repo:.../ref:refs/heads/main.-> Entra
    Entra --> AT
    AT --> AZ
    AZ --> Bicep
    Bicep --> ARM
    ARM --> RG
